#: configdialog.cpp:49
msgid "&General"
msgstr "Algemeen"

#: configdialog.cpp:52
msgid "Ac&tions"
msgstr "Aksies"

#: configdialog.cpp:55
msgid "&Shortcuts"
msgstr "Kortpaaie "

#: configdialog.cpp:99
msgid "&Popup menu at mouse-cursor position"
msgstr "Opspring kieslys by muis-wyser posisie"

#: configdialog.cpp:101
msgid "Save clipboard contents on e&xit"
msgstr "Stoor klipbord inhoud wanneer program toemaak"

#: configdialog.cpp:103
msgid "Remove whitespace when executing actions"
msgstr "Verwyder spasie wanneer 'n aksie uitvoer"

#: configdialog.cpp:105
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the selected text has some whitespace at the end, which, if loaded "
"as URL in a browser would cause an error. Enabling this option removes any "
"whitespace at the beginning or end of the selected string (the original "
"clipboard contents will not be modified)."
msgstr ""
"Party keer het die gekiesde teks spasie of tabs aan die einde, wat foute sal "
"veroorsaak as dit bv. in 'n blaaier as 'n URL gebruik word. As hierdie opsie "
"gekies is, sal alle \"wit\" spasies (tabs, spasies) aan die begin en einde van "
"die gekiesde string verwyder word. Die oorspronklike item in die klipbord sal "
"nie verander word nie."

#: configdialog.cpp:107
msgid "&Replay actions on an item selected from history"
msgstr "Herspeel aksies op 'n item wat uit die geskiedenis gekies is."

#: configdialog.cpp:110
msgid "Pre&vent empty clipboard"
msgstr "Verhoed dat die klipbord leeg is"

#: configdialog.cpp:112
msgid ""
"Selecting this option has the effect, that the clipboard can never be emptied. "
"E.g. when an application exits, the clipboard would usually be emptied."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie gekies is, sal die klipbord nooit leeg gemaak word nie. Die "
"standaard gedrag is dat die klipbord leeg gemaak word wanneer 'n program "
"toegemaak word."

#: configdialog.cpp:117
msgid "&Ignore selection"
msgstr "Ignoreer gekiesde teks"

#: configdialog.cpp:119
msgid ""
"This option prevents the selection being recorded in the clipboard history. "
"Only explicit clipboard changes are recorded."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie gekies is, sal die klipbord geskiedenis nie die gekiesde teks "
"opneem nie. Slegs eksplisiete veranderinge in die klipbord sal aangeteken word."

#: configdialog.cpp:123
msgid "Clipboard/Selection Behavior"
msgstr "Klipbord/Keuse Gedrag"

#: configdialog.cpp:127
msgid ""
"<qt>There are two different clipboard buffers available:"
"<br>"
"<br><b>Clipboard</b> is filled by selecting something and pressing Ctrl+C, or "
"by clicking \"Copy\" in a toolbar or menubar."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Selection</b> is available immediately after selecting some text. The "
"only way to access the selection is to press the middle mouse button."
"<br>"
"<br>You can configure the relationship between Clipboard and Selection.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Daar is twee verskillende klipbord buffers beskikbaar:"
"<br>"
"<br><b>Klipbord</b> word gevul wanneer iets gekies word en daarna Ctrl+C gedruk "
"word, of op \"Kopiëer\" in 'n nutsbalk of kieslysbalk gedruk word."
"<br>"
"<br><b>Keuse</b> is dadelik beskikbaar sodra teks gekies is. Die enigste manier "
"hoe hierdie keuse gebruik kan word is deur die middel muis knoppie te druk."
"<br>"
"<br>"
"<br>Die verhouding tussen Klipbord en Keuse kan opgestel word.</qt>"

#: configdialog.cpp:138
msgid "Sy&nchronize contents of the clipboard and the selection"
msgstr "Sinkroniseer inhoud van die klipbord en die keuse"

#: configdialog.cpp:141
msgid ""
"Selecting this option synchronizes these two buffers, so they work the same way "
"as in KDE 1.x and 2.x."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie gekies is, sal die twee buffers (Klipbord en keuse) "
"gesinkroniseer wees. Die gedrag stem ooreen met KDE 1.x en 2.x"

#: configdialog.cpp:145
msgid "Separate clipboard and selection"
msgstr "Aparte klipbord en keuse"

#: configdialog.cpp:148
msgid ""
"Using this option will only set the selection when highlighting something and "
"the clipboard when choosing e.g. \"Copy\" in a menubar."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie gekies is, sal die keuse-buffer die teks bevat sodra dit "
"verlig word. Die klipbord-buffer sal slegs die verligte teks bevat sodra "
"\"Kopiëer\" uit die kieslys gekies word."

#: configdialog.cpp:155
msgid "Tim&eout for action popups:"
msgstr "Tyd wat gereserveer word vir aksie opspring vensters:"

#: configdialog.cpp:157
msgid " sec"
msgstr " sek"

#: configdialog.cpp:158
msgid "A value of 0 disables the timeout"
msgstr "'n Waarde van 0 sal die tyd teller deaktiveer"

#: configdialog.cpp:161
msgid "C&lipboard history size:"
msgstr "Klipbord geskiedenis grootte:"

#: configdialog.cpp:183
msgid ""
"_n:  entry\n"
" entries"
msgstr ""
" inskrywing\n"
" inskrywings"

#: configdialog.cpp:229
msgid "Action &list (right click to add/remove commands):"
msgstr "Aksie lys (regterkant kliek om opdragte te verwyder of by te voeg):"

#: configdialog.cpp:233
msgid "Regular Expression (see http://doc.trolltech.com/qregexp.html#details)"
msgstr ""
"Natuurlike Uitdrukkings (Kyk na http://dok.trolltech.com/qregexp.html#details)"

#: configdialog.cpp:234
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beskrywing"

#: configdialog.cpp:286
msgid "&Use graphical editor for editing regular expressions"
msgstr "Gebruik grafiese redigeerder om natuurlike uitdrukkings te redigeer"

#: configdialog.cpp:295
msgid "&Add Action"
msgstr "Voeg aksie by"

#: configdialog.cpp:298
msgid "&Delete Action"
msgstr "Vee aksie uit"

#: configdialog.cpp:301
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Click on a highlighted item's column to change it. \"%s\" in a command will be "
"replaced with the clipboard contents."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op 'n verligte item se kolom om dit te verander. \"%s\" in 'n opdrag sal "
"vervang word met die klipbord inhoud."

#: configdialog.cpp:307
msgid "Advanced..."
msgstr "Gevorderd..."

#: configdialog.cpp:332
